      "side": 1,
      "message": "I installed a new Gerrit site using this version and tried to configure All-Projects to block a user via singleusergroup plugin from posting comments:\n\n- block `Post Review Comments` on `refs/*` for user `user/test`\n- block `Label Code Review -2 .. +2` on `refs/heads/*` and `refs/meta/config` for user `user/test`\n\nWith that the user `test` was still able to post comments.\nWhat did I miss ?\n\nI think the rule that users which can vote on any label implicitly have the permission to post reviews makes it unnecessarily complex to block a user or group of users from posting review comments. At least the documentation should describe how to achieve that.",
